  internet and asks how digital infrastructure could be organized around pu
 blic values rather than private interests\, with an artistic intermezzo by
  Jen Liu.
LOCATION:De Balie\, Kleine-Gartmanplantsoen 10\, 1017 RR Amsterdam
URL:https://debalie.nl/programma/the-politics-of-the-internet-14-10-2026/
CATEGORIES:digital infrastructure\,internet\,public values
